          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d176cb98a36dec479a72dd64de3f3ca93d676a84",
          "message": "fix(ci): skip hf download for cached models in SGLang benchmark (#2780)\n\n`hf download --local-dir` creates lock files under the model's\n`.cache/huggingface/download` even when every file is already present,\nso any transient write failure on the shared model NFS (e.g. Disk quota\nexceeded) failed benchmark jobs whose model was fully cached.\n\nSkip the download when the model directory has `config.json` and a\n`.atom_download_complete` / `.download-complete` marker, matching\ndownload_model_with_lock.sh and the accuracy workflows, and write\n`.download-complete` after a successful download so later runs skip it.",
