            "extra": "Run: https://github.com/ROCm/ATOM/actions/runs/43686077473 | Threshold: 0.96 | Baseline: 0.97 | BaselineModel: moonshotai/Kimi-K3.1-Pro | BaselineNote: Kimi-K3.1-Pro, TP8 DCP8, BF16 MLA KV, FP8 index cache, mono decode on, at the server's default compilation level and graph mode. Measured GSM8K 5-shot flexible-extract 0.9765 / 0.9757 on MI355X with the recipes/Kimi-K3.1.md launch (which also pins level 0, FULL graphs, 2048 batched tokens, 0.85 memory and AITER_CUSTOM_AR_MAX_SIZE); CI runs 3-shot at the defaults, so baseline 0.97 and threshold 0.96 until the first CI run reports its own value. | Docker: rocm/atom-dev:nightly_202611141523 | GPU: AMD Radeon Graphics | VRAM: 288GB | ROCm: 7.2.4 | strict-match: 0.9742 | fewshot: 3 | Model: /models/moonshotai/Kimi-K3.1-Pro"
