          "message": "test(moe): set use_flydsl_herd on test_comm_fused_moe's hand-built Mxfp4MoEMethod (#3393)\n\n#2713 has Mxfp4MoEMethod.apply() read use_flydsl_herd. The\n_mxfp4_method_with_recording_experts helper builds the method with\nobject.__new__ and sets apply()'s other flags itself, so it sets this one too,\nas test_mega_mxfp4_method and test_mxfp4_triton_moe_decode do.\n\nCo-authored-by: JiaoliangYu <Jiaoliang.Yu@amd.com>",
