          "id": "5f3ae2b5be695df4cf6cf53a16b226b6f8e73301",
          "message": "[ATOMesh] Add GLM-5.2-MXFP4 2P1D TP8 coverage (#2508)\n\n* Add GLM-5.2-MXFP4 2P1D TP8 test case\n\nAdds glm-52-mxfp4-2p1d-tp8 under GLM-5.2-MXFP4 nightly suite:\n- Topology: 2p1d, multi_node layout (3 nodes)\n- 2 prefill workers (TP8 each) + 1 decode worker (TP8)\n- Concurrency sweep: 256, 512, 768, 1024\n- Accuracy eval enabled (GSM8K), eval_concurrency [128, 768]\n\nFollows MiniMax-M3-MXFP8 2P1D TP8 pattern from #2272.\n\nSigned-off-by: Tej Kiran <kiran.tej@amd.com>\n\n* Address review: add decode_max_num_seqs for 2P1D concurrency\n\n- Add decode_max_num_seqs: 1024 so decode can handle the full\n  concurrency range [256..1024]\n- Note: run_eval uses model-level accuracy config (GSM8K 20-shot)\n\nSigned-off-by: Tej Kiran <kiran.tej@amd.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Tej Kiran <kiran.tej@amd.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tej Kiran <kiran.tej@amd.com>",
