          "id": "25a7d7dda353ba31a04b4ac63b8d96f7579ee386",
          "message": "[TBO] Hold comm outputs only on PCP gathers: fix V4-Pro TP/DP TBO GPU fault (#3457)\n\n#2789 made tbo_on_comm record_stream every comm output, including the\nper-layer TP all-reduce and the DP gather / reduce-scatter. Under TBO\nprefill the held blocks pile up in the caching allocator (+4-5 GB reserved\nper step on V4-Pro TP8) until HIP fails to allocate kernel scratch:\nHSA_STATUS_ERROR_OUT_OF_RESOURCES.\n\nAdd tbo_on_comm(..., hold=True) and pass hold=False on the TP all-reduce\nand the DP gather / reduce-scatters, restoring their pre-#2789 behavior.\nThe PCP gathers keep the hold.\n\nAlso fix the test_tbo.py _run_experts stub, broken since #3132 passes\nshared_add / shared_ready.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
