          "message": "docs(recipes): Qwen3.5 AgentX recipe for the MXFP4 InferenceX submission (#3255)\n\n* docs(recipes): Qwen3.5 AgentX recipe for the MXFP4 InferenceX submission\n\nRewrite Agentic-Qwen3.5.md as the configuration ATOM submits to InferenceX:\nthe MXFP4-AttnFP8-V2 checkpoint, TP4 and TP2 points, LMCache from CONC 48\nat TP4 and from CONC 16 at TP2, the PrefillDelayer settings per point, and\nno quantized all-reduce.\n\n* docs(recipes): Qwen3.5 AgentX: GDN state-tier capacity at TP4 and TP2\n\nGive the state-tier capacity per rank at both TP4 and TP2, and state that the TP2 LMCache points use the TP4 per-rank sizes.",
