          "message": "ci(atomesh): restore the Spur MI350X nightly on fabric-5,6,7,8 (#3626)\n\n* ci(atomesh): restore the Spur MI350X nightly schedule\n\nBrings back the 10 16 UTC cron that #3208 removed. EVENT_SCHEDULE again\npicks MoRI IO accuracy only for the 10 4 cron, so the 10 16 cron runs the\nnightly suite, and each cron keeps its own concurrency group so MoRI IO\ndoes not queue behind the multi-day nightly. The schedule tests check both\ncrons again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(atomesh): run the MI350X lane on fabric-5,6,7,8\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
