            "extra": "Run: https://github.com/ROCm/ATOM/actions/runs/45437300894 | Threshold: 0.94 | Baseline: 0.95 | BaselineModel: moonshotai/Kimi-K3 + Inferact/Kimi-K3-DSpark | BaselineNote: The only pipeline-parallel accuracy case: Kimi-K3 pp2 x tp4 with DSpark (7 tokens) and prefix caching on, which together exercise the PP-only paths -- the undeferred verify window, the cross-stage aux relay, the checkpoint hold and a KDA state fork landing on a verify step. Eager because PP decode has no CUDA graphs yet, hence the longer timeout. ptpc_fp8 online quant on the target only, as the Kimi-K3 TP8 case runs it (that case has no drafter); \"context_proj\" and \"layers\" (the draft's unprefixed module names, which no target module matches) keep the DSpark draft in BF16 as the Kimi-K3 DSpark TP8 case runs it. Spec decode is lossless, so baseline and threshold match Kimi-K3. | Docker: rocm/atom-dev:nightly_202611241524 | GPU: AMD Radeon Graphics | VRAM: 288GB | ROCm: 7.2.4 | strict-match: 0.9629 | fewshot: 3 | Model: /models/moonshotai/Kimi-K3"
